    "@value" : "software developer role"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A person primarily responsible for programming, software development, designing computer programs, implementation of the computer code and supporting algorithms, and testing of existing code components."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@value" : "Kind of Source: Quotation. Source of definition: CRedit, p. 8 "
